              "xpath=//p[2]",
              "xpath:position"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "Battleship is a turn-based 2-player game. Each player has a 10x10 grid with a fleet of five ships, of 5, 4, 3, 3 and 2 squares, placed at random at the start of the game. The players take turns firing at the opponent's grid and try to sink the enemy fleet. Hits are shown with fire and misses with a water splash. When a player hits an opponent's ship, they can fire again. The player who sinks the whole of their opponent's fleet wins the game."
        }
      ]
